\f1\fs22 The platform had gone up in front of the engineering tower for reasons that were, on the paperwork, entirely about production: the tower held the sound desk and the lighting rig, every cable in the Domain ran home to it, and anybody who mattered was to be kept where the cables were. The Elvi had accepted this logic and then improved on it, the way they improved on everything, which was sideways. By mid-afternoon the scaffolding wore carpet, the carpet wore bunting, the whole structure wore a canopy fringed in gold, and under the canopy stood two thrones now on their third career \'97 burlesque first, then the Inauguration, now this \'97 and two ordinary folding chairs, because in the theology of the Elvi the Holy Momma and the Great Teacher sat enthroned, but aunts sat like everybody else.\
